          <span class="small-heading"><p>#43 Don A. Roces Ave.Quezon City Metro Manila Philippines</p></span>
          <span class="small-heading">
            <p>Tel.: (+632) 7738 2844; Smart +63 998 983 4535; Globe +63 915 339 7985</p>
          </span>
        </div>
